    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanPostProcessor</code></a> that honours <a href=\"ImportAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportAware</code></a> callback using\na mapping computed at build time.",
      "translation": "一个在构建时计算映射，以支持使用 `<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanPostProcessor</code></a>` 的、尊重 `<a href=\"ImportAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportAware</code></a>` 回调的处理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns the given <code>bean</code> as-is.",
      "translation": "默认实现原样返回给定的<code>bean</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Higher values are interpreted as lower priority. As a consequence,\nthe object with the lowest value has the highest priority (somewhat\nanalogous to Servlet <code>load-on-startup</code> values).",
      "translation": "较高的值被解释为较低的优先级。因此，具有最低值的对象具有最高的优先级（类似于 Servlet 的 `<code>load-on-startup</code>` 值）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Same order values will result in arbitrary sort positions for the\naffected objects.",
      "translation": "相同的顺序值将导致受影响的对象具有任意的排序位置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply this <code>BeanPostProcessor</code> to the given new bean instance <i>before</i> any bean\ninitialization callbacks (like InitializingBean's <code>afterPropertiesSet</code>\nor a custom init-method).",
      "translation": "将此 `<code>BeanPostProcessor`</code> 应用于给定的新 Bean 实例，在任意 Bean 初始化回调（例如 `InitializingBean` 的 `<code>afterPropertiesSet</code>` 或自定义的 init-method）之前。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
